1 NAME Erik Gustafsson /Ruuth/
2 GIVN Erik Gustafsson
2 SURN Ruuth
2 _MARNM Ruuth
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 24 OCT 1746
2 PLAC Skeppsholmen
2 ADDR
3 CITY Stockholm
3 CTRY Sweden
