1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Auguste-Louis Brot''', landowner, med. doctor, born 1821-09-18 in Genova, died 1896-08-30 in Genèva.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Married 1851-06-20''' in Geneva to [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/De_Geer_af_Leufsta_nr_131#TAB_9 '''Françoise-''Amelie'' De Geer af Leufsta'''], born 1829-08-14 at Vernaz in Haute-Savoie, died 1895-01-09 in Geneve.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Auguste Louis Brot=
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Auguste_Louis_Brot '''Auguste Louis Brot'''] was a Swiss malacologist (conchologist).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''After several years''' of studies in Zurich, Paris, and Berlin, he earned the degree of Doctor in Medicine in 1845. Soon he became deeply interested in natural history, abandoned medicine, returned to Geneva and became a malaco
2 CONC logist, with a special interest in terrestrial and aquatic molluscs. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''For over 40 years''' he was associated with the Natural History Museum of Geneva. He was an elected correspondent (1887) of the Academy of Natural Sciences of Philadelphia.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''He is a conchological''' [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taxon_authority taxon authority] and the namesake of the [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brotia Brotia] genus of freshwater snails. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brotia_pa
2 CONC godula Brotia pagodula] is one species of freshwater snail with an operculum, an aquatic gastropod mollusk in the family Pachychilidae, named after him.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The Geneva museum''' keeps his book collection and his extensive conchological collection.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Monographs===
2 CONT
2 CONT *1880: Die Gattung Paludomus auct. (Tanalia, Stomatodon, Philopotamis, Paludomus) (Melaniaceen)
2 CONT * 1874: Systematisches Conchylien-Cabinet Die Melaniaceen : (Melanidae) ; in Abbildungen nach der Natur mit Beschreibungen.
2 CONT * 1874: Die Melaniaceen (Melanidae) in Abbildungen nach der Natur mit Beschreibungen
2 CONT * 1870: Catalogue of the Recent Species of the Family Melanidae
2 CONT * 1868: Additions et corrections au catalogue systématique des escèces qui composent la famille des Mélaniens
2 CONT * 1868: Matériaux pour servir a l'étude de la famille des Melaniens
2 CONT * 1867: Étude sur les coquilles de la famille des nayades qui habitent le bassin du Léman
2 CONT * 1862 Matériaux pour servir à l'étude de la famille des mélaniens. Catalogue systematique, Volume 1
2 CONT * 1860: Description de nouvelles espèces de mélanies
