2 CONC d his father to said Sir David dated 16 and 19 December 1717. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD164%2f351&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=david+murray+of+stanhope&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1707&dt=17
