1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Lady Frances de Nassau d'Auverquerque''' was born 1700s, the Daughter of [http://www.geni.com/people/Hendrik-van-Nassau-Ouderkerk/6000000000856849109 Hendrik van Nassau Ouderkerk, 1st Earl of Grantham] and [http
2 CONC ://www.geni.com/people/Henrietta-Butler/6000000000856698252 Henrietta Butler].
2 CONT
2 CONT Her parents were first cousins.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Captain (later Lieutenant-Colonel) William Elliot of Wells on the 4 Jun 1737 St Paul's Benet Wharf against her father's wishes . 
2 CONT
2 CONT Their only child died young.
2 CONT
2 CONT She herself dies on  5 April 1772.
