2 CONT Author & Librarian At Royal Academy, Uppsala, Sweden Professor in Literary History at University of Uppsala. Librarian at University of Uppsala and famous coin collector. Ewald Ziervogel was a professor at the University of Uppsal
2 CONC a. Amongst other things he made a map of the whole of Africa. 
