2 CONT Paternal granny Martha Danielssons fathers mothers maternal granny. She was Emmanuel von Düben's housekeeper (husföreståndarinna).  Her official father was a bondager at the Harviala manor near Tavastehus.
2 CONT
2 CONT She is supposed to be a natural daughter to Emmanuel von Düben. According to granny he paid for her education.
