2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Johan_August_Meijerfeldt
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan August Meijerfeldt (1664 - 1749) was a Swedish general, He commanded Swedish forces at the Battle of Pozon during the Great Northern War.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Pozna%C5%84_(1704)
2 CONT
