1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/De_Geer_af_Leufsta_nr_131#TAB_13 '''''Carl'' Gustave Adrien De Geer af Leufsta'''], born 1890-04-21 in Eaux-Vives. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lieutenant in the''' 1st Swiss Cavalry Regiment. Attaché at the Swiss Mission in Paris. 2nd legation secretary at the said mission. Licencié en droit. Swiss 1st legation secretary in waiting. RFrHL. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Died on 1955-06-07''' in Geneva.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Married 1917-08-09''' in Paris to '''''Catherine'' Blanche Suzanne Schlumberger''', born 1895-08-29 at [https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ch%C3%A2teau_de_Crassy Crassier Castle] in France, died 1959. Daughter of French minister Ema
2 CONC nuel Schlumberger and Isabelle Monnrier.
